<title>UK: Entreprise Inns sees Q1 results in line.</title>
<headline>Entreprise Inns sees Q1 results in line.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent pub company Enterprise Inns said on Tuesday that results for the first quarter of the current year had been in line with its expectations.</p>
